{"problem_id": "2facde32-c0ff-47bd-a2d2-faa8917b8cf0", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 9, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:10:49.843650+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}\"></span> ,  где числа <i>a</i>, <i>b</i> и <i>c</i>  — целые. Най­ди­те  <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем вы­ра­же­ние, за­да­ю­щее функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac+b-ac}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac}{x+c}+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}=a+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <span data-inline-latex=\"y=-4\"></span>, зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=-4\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:46.897291+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/7335c36d-ae50-435d-81c6-c904484202c8\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}\"></span> ,  где числа <i>a</i>, <i>b</i> и <i>c</i>  — целые. Най­ди­те  <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">-4</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "source", "html": "<p>Источник: <a href=\"https://analys-urok.sdamgia.ru/problem?id=4744\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">4744</a></p>", "title": "Источник", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "source:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:source:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем вы­ра­же­ние, за­да­ю­щее функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac+b-ac}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac}{x+c}+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}=a+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <span data-inline-latex=\"y=-4\"></span>, зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=-4\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}